# Whitelist .gitignore — ignore EVERYTHING by default.
# This protects Solutions/ (confidential client work), internal .md docs
# and website/backup (old/reference site snapshots) from ever being committed or published.
/*

# Allow only the public website files (the deployable static site)
!/.gitignore
!/wrangler.jsonc
!/website/
/website/*
!/website/main/

# wrangler files
.wrangler
.dev.vars*
!.dev.vars.example
.env*
!.env.example
